This License grants permission to use the Software subject to its conditions.

It does not transfer copyright ownership of the original SniffRTP code.

Copyright in original SniffRTP code remains with its copyright holder.

Contributors may retain copyright in their separately authored modifications, subject to the continuing license obligations applying to SniffRTP-derived portions.

